  title="AI Music on Radio Odyssey: What We Play and How We Say So"
  description="Radio Odyssey plays some tracks made with artificial intelligence, in its Discoveries sequence. Our rules, our reasons, what we cannot guarantee, and what other broadcasters do."
  articleDatePublished="2026-11-14"
>
